{"id": "audit_v0_met_39936_mingwu", "artwork_id": "met_39936", "dimension": "mingwu", "model": "OpenGVLab/InternVL2_5-2B", "quantization": "bf16", "tokenizer_source": "bundle/tokenizer_patched_2b", "max_num": 12, "n_tiles": 9, "max_new_tokens": 768, "seconds": 8.7, "peak_mem_gb": 6.33, "answer": "画面中有三只禽鸟，分别栖于左上、中下和右上的树枝。竹子的画法与鸟的栖枝指向了“写意花鸟”的传统。", "error": "", "ts_cst": "2026-11-15 19:35:40"}
{"id": "audit_v0_met_39936_bimo", "artwork_id": "met_39936", "dimension": "bimo", "model": "OpenGVLab/InternVL2_5-2B", "quantization": "bf16", "tokenizer_source": "bundle/tokenizer_patched_2b", "max_num": 12, "n_tiles": 9, "max_new_tokens": 768, "seconds": 9.1, "peak_mem_gb": 6.32, "answer": "这幅画的设色以淡雅的褐色为主，线条细腻流畅，体现了传统中国画的工笔画风格。竹叶的用笔较为细腻，线条流畅，而鸟羽的用笔则显得更加简练和有力。竹叶的描绘注重细节和层次感，而鸟羽的线条则显得更加飘逸和生动。", "error": "", "ts_cst": "2026-11-15 19:35:49"}
{"id": "audit_v0_met_39936_yixiang", "artwork_id": "met_39936", "dimension": "yixiang", "model": "OpenGVLab/InternVL2_5-2B", "quantization": "bf16", "tokenizer_source": "bundle/tokenizer_patched_2b", "max_num": 12, "n_tiles": 9, "max_new_tokens": 768, "seconds": 11.2, "peak_mem_gb": 6.33, "answer": "这幅画描绘了春天或初夏的景象，通过竹子的嫩绿和鸟类的生机勃勃得以体现。竹子的生长和鸟类的活跃状态象征着新生与活力，营造出一种清新、充满生机的氛围。在传统画论中，禽鸟与竹的组合常寄托着“风雅”的意境，即自然之美和人类情感的融合，体现了人与自然的和谐。", "error": "", "ts_cst": "2026-11-15 19:57:52"}
{"id": "audit_v0_met_40062_mingwu", "artwork_id": "met_40062", "dimension": "mingwu", "model": "OpenGVLab/InternVL2_5-2B", "quantization": "bf16", "tokenizer_source": "bundle/tokenizer_patched_2b", "max_num": 12, "n_tiles": 10, "max_new_tokens": 768, "seconds": 11.7, "peak_mem_gb": 6.52, "answer": "画面中松树下的建筑是亭子，画面中山石与树木的组合指向了魏晋南北朝时期的山水风格。", "error": "", "ts_cst": "2026-11-15 19:58:04"}
{"id": "audit_v0_met_40062_bimo", "artwork_id": "met_40062", "dimension": "bimo", "model": "OpenGVLab/InternVL2_5-2B", "quantization": "bf16", "tokenizer_source": "bundle/tokenizer_patched_2b", "max_num": 12, "n_tiles": 10, "max_new_tokens": 768, "seconds": 10.4, "peak_mem_gb": 6.52, "answer": "松针、山石的皴法特点：松针采用点状笔法，山石采用皴法。墨色浓淡：墨色从松针的细密点状笔法到山石的较为粗犷的皴法，表现出层次感。", "error": "", "ts_cst": "2026-11-15 19:58:14"}
{"id": "audit_v0_met_40062_yixiang", "artwork_id": "met_40062", "dimension": "yixiang", "model": "OpenGVLab/InternVL2_5-2B", "quantization": "bf16", "tokenizer_source": "bundle/tokenizer_patched_2b", "max_num": 12, "n_tiles": 10, "max_new_tokens": 768, "seconds": 9.3, "peak_mem_gb": 6.51, "answer": "这幅画描绘了隐士与自然和谐共处的场景，传达了隐士理想中与自然和谐共处的生活。", "error": "", "ts_cst": "2026-11-15 19:58:24"}
{"id": "audit_v0_met_40057_mingwu", "artwork_id": "met_40057", "dimension": "mingwu", "model": "OpenGVLab/InternVL2_5-2B", "quantization": "bf16", "tokenizer_source": "bundle/tokenizer_patched_2b", "max_num": 12, "n_tiles": 7, "max_new_tokens": 768, "seconds": 6.7, "peak_mem_gb": 5.94, "answer": "画面中渔人的舟船是简朴的，渔具是基本的。江岸的建筑与树木指向古代的东亚地域风貌。", "error": "", "ts_cst": "2026-11-15 19:58:31"}
{"id": "audit_v0_met_40057_bimo", "artwork_id": "met_40057", "dimension": "bimo", "model": "OpenGVLab/InternVL2_5-2B", "quantization": "bf16", "tokenizer_source": "bundle/tokenizer_patched_2b", "max_num": 12, "n_tiles": 7, "max_new_tokens": 768, "seconds": 6.4, "peak_mem_gb": 5.94, "answer": "远山与近水的墨色层次处理得非常细腻，渔翁人物的用笔与山水有明显的区别。", "error": "", "ts_cst": "2026-11-15 19:58:37"}
{"id": "audit_v0_met_40057_yixiang", "artwork_id": "met_40057", "dimension": "yixiang", "model": "OpenGVLab/InternVL2_5-2B", "quantization": "bf16", "tokenizer_source": "bundle/tokenizer_patched_2b", "max_num": 12, "n_tiles": 7, "max_new_tokens": 768, "seconds": 7.0, "peak_mem_gb": 5.94, "answer": "在中国山水画中，渔父形象通常象征着闲适和隐逸的生活境界。这幅画通过其氛围传达出一种苍茫感，强调了自然景观的广阔和深远。", "error": "", "ts_cst": "2026-11-15 19:58:44"}
