{"id": "audit_v0_met_62002_yixiang", "artwork_id": "met_62002", "dimension": "yixiang", "model": "OpenGVLab/InternVL2_5-2B", "quantization": "bf16", "tokenizer_source": "bundle/tokenizer_patched_2b", "max_num": 12, "n_tiles": 9, "max_new_tokens": 768, "seconds": 9.1, "peak_mem_gb": 6.32, "answer": "这幅画描绘的是文成公主，她在中国文化中被视为联结不同民族的桥梁。她被描绘成一位身穿华丽服饰、手持象征和平的权杖的女性形象，背景是象征和平与繁荣的云朵。", "error": "", "ts_cst": "2026-11-15 20:04:53"}
